<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="my">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0B0E14">
<title>အကြောင်းအရာ — MACHINE SEARCH</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="brand.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="components.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="bg.css">
<style>
  :root {
    --ms-red: #E11D3E;
    --ms-red-dark: #990B24;
    --ms-red-bright: #FF2A4B;
    --ms-bg: #141821;
    --ms-bg-deep: #0D1017;
    --ms-surface: #1C2230;
    --ms-surface-elevated: #232B3D;
    --ms-surface-soft: #171C28;
    --ms-border: #2E374B;
    --ms-border-strong: #3F4B66;
    --ms-text: #F1F5F9;
    --ms-text-secondary: #CBD5E1;
    --ms-muted: #94A3B8;
    --ms-ok: #22C55E;
    --ms-3d-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35), 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
    --ms-3d-red: 0 6px 14px rgba(225, 29, 62, 0.32), 0 2px 0 #690517;
  }

  *, *::before, *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  body.ms-about-body {
    background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, #1D2434 0%, var(--ms-bg) 52%, var(--ms-bg-deep) 100%) !important;
    color: var(--ms-text) !important;
    margin: 0;
    min-height: 100vh;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  body.ms-about-body .topbar,
  body.ms-about-body .app-header,
  body.ms-about-body .ms-header {
    background: var(--ms-surface) !important;
    color: var(--ms-text) !important;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--ms-red) !important;
  }

  .ms-shell {
    max-width: 1080px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 10px 12px 96px;
  }

  .ms-3d-brand {
    color: #FF4D6A;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-style: italic;
    letter-spacing: 0.4px;
    text-shadow:
      0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14),
      0 2px 0 #6B0517,
      0 5px 14px rgba(225, 29, 62, 0.35);
  }

  /* Hero Banner */
  .ms-about-hero {
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: linear-gradient(115deg, var(--ms-surface-elevated) 0%, #241B29 54%, #7A0B20 84%, #3B0410 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--ms-border-strong);
    padding: 14px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    box-shadow: var(--ms-3d-shadow);
  }

  .ms-about-hero-title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(20px, 4.8vw, 28px);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 0 #0A0D14, 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }

  .ms-about-hero-sub {
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ms-text-secondary);
  }

  .ms-meta-pills {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .ms-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 800;
    background: rgba(13, 16, 23, 0.84);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
    color: var(--ms-text);
  }

  /* Section Banner */
  .ms-sec-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 14px 0 8px;
  }

  .ms-sec-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--ms-red-bright), var(--ms-red-dark));
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 900;
    padding: 5px 14px 5px 11px;
    border-radius: 6px 16px 6px 6px;
    box-shadow: var(--ms-3d-red);
  }

  /* Card */
  .ms-card {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--ms-surface-elevated) 0%, var(--ms-surface) 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--ms-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    box-shadow: var(--ms-3d-shadow);
  }

  .ms-desc-para {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ms-text-secondary);
  }

  .ms-desc-para:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Features Grid */
  .ms-feat-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .ms-feat-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    padding: 10px 11px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--ms-surface-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--ms-border);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ms-text);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .ms-feat-badge {
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--ms-red-bright), var(--ms-red-dark));
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 900;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(225, 29, 62, 0.35);
  }

  /* Developer Profile Card */
  .ms-dev-card {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 12px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #252E42 0%, #191F2D 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--ms-border-strong);
  }

  .ms-dev-avatar {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--ms-red-bright), var(--ms-red-dark));
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 900;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    box-shadow: var(--ms-3d-red);
  }

  .ms-dev-name {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 900;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    letter-spacing: 0.3px;
  }

  .ms-dev-role {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #FF6B84;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .ms-dev-app {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--ms-text-secondary);
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* Info Rows */
  .ms-info-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .ms-info-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 9px 11px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--ms-surface-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--ms-border);
    font-size: 12.5px;
  }

  .ms-info-key {
    color: var(--ms-muted);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ms-info-val {
    color: var(--ms-text);
    font-weight: 800;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .ms-copyright {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 12px 10px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--ms-surface-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--ms-border);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ms-text-secondary);
  }

  .ms-btn-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ms-btn {
    flex: 1 1 150px;
    min-height: 38px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border: 1px solid var(--ms-border-strong);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #2C354A 0%, #1F2636 100%);
    color: var(--ms-text);
  }

  .ms-btn-red {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--ms-red-bright) 0%, var(--ms-red) 55%, var(--ms-red-dark) 100%);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border: none;
    box-shadow: var(--ms-3d-red);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .ms-shell { padding: 8px 10px 92px; }
    .ms-feat-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">


</head>
<body class="ms-about-body">
<div id="app"></div>

<script src="app.js?v=1016"></script>
<script>
(function() {
  const app = document.getElementById('app');
  app.innerHTML =
    MS.backHeader('အကြောင်းအရာ') +
    `<main class="ms-shell">
      <section class="ms-about-hero">
        <h1 class="ms-about-hero-title"><span class="ms-3d-brand">MACHINE SEARCH</span> အကြောင်း</h1>
        <div class="ms-about-hero-sub">Arcade Machine Information System · Offline Web Application</div>
        <div class="ms-meta-pills">
          <span class="ms-pill">ဗားရှင်း 1.0.0</span>
          <span class="ms-pill" style="color:var(--ms-ok);">✓ 100% Offline အသုံးပြုနိုင်သည်</span>
          <span class="ms-pill">Developer: Super ko Tint</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="ms-sec-head">
        <div class="ms-sec-pill"><span>📖</span><span>စနစ်ခြုံငုံသုံးသပ်ချက်</span></div>
      </div>
      <section class="ms-card">
        <p class="ms-desc-para">
          MACHINE SEARCH သည် Arcade Game Machine များ၏ အချက်အလက်များ၊ Error Code များ၊ Machine ပြဿနာများနှင့် ဖြေရှင်းနည်းများကို လွယ်ကူမြန်ဆန်စွာ ရှာဖွေကြည့်ရှုနိုင်ရန် ဖန်တီးထားသော စနစ်တစ်ခုဖြစ်ပါသည်။
        </p>
        <p class="ms-desc-para">
          Machine အချက်အလက်များကို စနစ်တကျ စုစည်းထားပြီး အသုံးပြုသူများအနေဖြင့် လိုအပ်သော အချက်အလက်များကို အချိန်တိုအတွင်း ရှာဖွေနိုင်ပါသည်။
        </p>
        <p class="ms-desc-para">
          Internet ချိတ်ဆက်မှုမရှိဘဲ Offline အသုံးပြုနိုင်ရန် ရည်ရွယ်ထားပြီး Arcade Machine နည်းပညာဆိုင်ရာ အချက်အလက်များ၊ ပြဿနာဖြေရှင်းနည်းများနှင့် အသုံးဝင်သော နည်းပညာအကြောင်းအရာများကို တစ်နေရာတည်းတွင် စုစည်းပေးထားပါသည်။
        </p>
      </section>

      <div class="ms-sec-head">
        <div class="ms-sec-pill"><span>⚡</span><span>အဓိက လုပ်ဆောင်ချက်များ</span></div>
      </div>
      <section class="ms-card">
        <div class="ms-feat-grid">
          <div class="ms-feat-item"><span class="ms-feat-badge">1</span><span>Machine အချက်အလက် ရှာဖွေခြင်း</span></div>
          <div class="ms-feat-item"><span class="ms-feat-badge">2</span><span>Error Code ရှာဖွေခြင်း</span></div>
          <div class="ms-feat-item"><span class="ms-feat-badge">3</span><span>Machine အမျိုးအစားများ စီမံခြင်း</span></div>
          <div class="ms-feat-item"><span class="ms-feat-badge">4</span><span>Error ဖြေရှင်းနည်းများ ကြည့်ရှုခြင်း</span></div>
          <div class="ms-feat-item"><span class="ms-feat-badge">5</span><span>Solution ပုံများ ကြည့်ရှုခြင်း</span></div>
          <div class="ms-feat-item"><span class="ms-feat-badge">6</span><span>Favorites သိမ်းဆည်းခြင်း</span></div>
          <div class="ms-feat-item"><span class="ms-feat-badge">7</span><span>Offline အသုံးပြုနိုင်ခြင်း</span></div>
          <div class="ms-feat-item"><span class="ms-feat-badge">8</span><span>Database စီမံခန့်ခွဲခြင်း</span></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="ms-sec-head">
        <div class="ms-sec-pill"><span>👨‍💻</span><span>ဖန်တီးသူ အချက်အလက်</span></div>
      </div>
      <section class="ms-card">
        <div class="ms-dev-card">
          <div class="ms-dev-avatar">SKT</div>
          <div>
            <div class="ms-dev-name">SUPER KO TINT</div>
            <div class="ms-dev-role">Creator &amp; Developer</div>
            <div class="ms-dev-app">MACHINE SEARCH · Arcade Machine Information System</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ms-info-list">
          <div class="ms-info-row">
            <span class="ms-info-key">Application Name</span>
            <span class="ms-info-val">MACHINE SEARCH</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ms-info-row">
            <span class="ms-info-key">Developer</span>
            <span class="ms-info-val">Super ko Tint</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ms-info-row">
            <span class="ms-info-key">Version</span>
            <span class="ms-info-val">1.0.0</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ms-info-row">
            <span class="ms-info-key">Platform</span>
            <span class="ms-info-val">Offline Web Application</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ms-btn-row">
          <a href="settings.html" class="ms-btn ms-btn-red">Settings သို့သွားရန်</a>
          <a href="troubleshoot.html" class="ms-btn">Solution Center</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="ms-copyright">
        <div>© 2026 MACHINE SEARCH</div>
        <div>Developed by Super ko Tint</div>
        <div>All rights reserved.</div>
      </section>
    </main>` +
    MS.bottomNav('settings');
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
